{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BooBooBooster is a new side-scrolling 2D action shooter that combines attacking and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can be easily played with only two buttons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, despite it's colorful, pop-style graphics, the game poses a challenge that's anything but easy to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and gimmicks await the main character, which cannot be broken through by simple operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally, the way is also obstructed by the simple but peculiar controls...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 25 stages in total, and each stage has 3 missions! You may have a hard time collecting the missions so that you have to try several times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a reward for accomplishing such missions, you will receive points that can make your player stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to clear all the stages while collecting the missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The year is 20XX and the setting is New Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, a huge object in the shape of a peach crashed down,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the New Tokyo urban area was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon after, butt-shaped unidentified creatures begin to appear all over Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frightening thing they have in common is that they project their excrement onto humans,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their power was expanding day by day, causing people to suffer. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of all this, a young man who loves potatoes got his hands on a mysterious potato...!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step to Defeating the Demon King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3270560/41c270b2c5fa8d968d2b0690166b4a618c265908.j